    [*] --> Initiated

    state "Initiated" as Initiated
    state "Funds Held" as FundsHeld
    state "Submitted to Biller" as Submitted
    state "Completed" as Completed
    state "Failed" as Failed
    state "Rejected" as Rejected
    state "Unknown" as Unknown
    state "Refunded" as Refunded

    Initiated --> FundsHeld: Validation successful / Reserve funds

    Initiated --> Rejected: Validation failed or insufficient balance

    FundsHeld --> Submitted: Send payment request to biller

    Submitted --> Completed: Biller confirms success

    Submitted --> Failed: Biller confirms failure

    Submitted --> Unknown: Timeout or missing response

    Unknown --> Completed: Late success confirmation

    Unknown --> Failed: Late failure confirmation

    Failed --> Refunded: Release held funds

    Unknown --> Refunded: Confirmed failure / Release held funds

    Completed --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]
    Refunded --> [*]

    note right of Unknown
        Funds remain held.
        No automatic refund on timeout.
        Wait for biller confirmation.
    end note

    note right of Rejected
        No funds were reserved.
        No refund is required.
    end note

    note right of Completed
        Payment is successful.
        No normal refund transition.
    end note

    note right of Refunded
        Reserved funds returned
        to the customer's wallet.
    end note
